# What Price Loyalty (crystalWar 50), the Prog 2 zone-in from any zone (Task 5 review Minor 2): a level 99 Warrior in
# Beaucedine Glacier [S] with Beneath the Mask completed and the WotG mission Fate in Haze current (missions as the
# main flow); the quest accepted at Prog 2 (GMs). The main flow enters Xarcabard [S] at Prog 2 from Bastok Markets
# [S]; here from Beaucedine Glacier [S]: 8 all the same (left open), finished: Prog 3, the Commander's Endorsement.
# Prog 3: Xarcabard from Beaucedine again: nothing.
lists XarcabardS/onZoneIn/1 XarcabardS/onEventFinish/8
char zone=BeaucedineGlacierS pos=-262.077,-39.622,-329.347 job=WAR lvl=99
quest CrystalWar.BeneathTheMask completed
quest CrystalWar.WhatPriceLoyalty accepted
charvar Quest[7][50]Prog 2
mission Wotg FateInHaze current
mission Asa BurgeoningDread current
mission Acp ACrystallineProphecyFin current
mission Rov ARhapsodyForTheAges current
mission Soa Abomination current
login
warp -414,-46.5,20 XarcabardS open      # from Beaucedine Glacier [S] at Prog 2: 8, left open
finish                                  # Prog 3; the Commander's Endorsement
warp -262.077,-39.622,-329.347 BeaucedineGlacierS
warp -414,-46.5,20 XarcabardS           # from Beaucedine Glacier [S] at Prog 3: nothing
